00:14:33,680 --> 00:14:35,320
in support of your view, but you expected it

362
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:37,680
to be supportive, so then you should actually

363
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:39,840
become less confident if the study

364
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:42,420
isn't quite as supportive as you're expecting.

365
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:46,720
This is a lot like a company can announce profits

